What is DeltΔAddons?
---------------
DeltΔAddons is a custom vendor tree to add extras to your android ROMs. It adds unique sounds and wallpapers, privacy-respecting apps, and some useful utitilies.

Implement it!
---------------
### Download it straight into your local_manifests
* Using curl
```bash
mkdir local_manifests
curl -o .repo/local_manifests/deltaAddons.xml https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeltaAddons/local_manifests/refs/heads/_branch_/deltaAddons.xml
```
* Using wget
```bash
mkdir local_manifests
wget -P .repo/local_manifests/deltaAddons.xml https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeltaAddons/local_manifests/refs/heads/_branch_/deltaAddons.xml
```

### Integrate it to your ROM source manifests
* Add it as a git submodules
```bash
git submodule add -b _branch_ https://github.com/DeltaPrjkts/local_manifests.git ./deltaSnippets
```
* Integrate with `default.xml`, add it to the end of the manifests
```xml
<include name="path/to/deltaAddons.xml" />
```
* Comment the project on other .xml's related to these:
    * Backgrounds
    * ColumbusService
    * ElmyraService
    * Launcher3 (optional) (if you dont want to use it, make sure to comment out the project in deltaAddons.xml)
* Extra: Init / Reinit your repo
If you use forked repos of your ROM source manifests, make sure to push and then reinit the repo
```bash
repo init --submodules -u your_repo -b your_branch --git-lfs
```
